# pgs2srt Localization Catalog — English (en)
#
# Adding a new UI language:
#   1. Copy `en.lang` to `<iso_code>.lang` (e.g. `fr.lang`) in `crates/pgs-core/locales/`.
#   2. Translate the values on the right side of `=` (keep `{placeholder}` names intact).
#   3. Register the locale in `define_ui_languages!` inside `crates/pgs-core/src/i18n/mod.rs`.
#      Missing keys automatically fall back to English (`en.lang`).

